      "summary": "An agent send no longer waits on the platform's digest before its first request. The run identity's SHA-256 values are now computed synchronously (equal to `sha256Hex` and `canonicalSha256` on the same input, so every identity keeps its value): a busy thread pool held each request back by an unbounded number of event-loop turns, and on a page without `crypto.subtle` (plain http other than localhost) every send was refused.",
      "id": "identity-sync"
    }
  ],
